{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2677000/extras/Frog_Ready_to_jump.png?t=1743057643\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Charge... keep charging... and then jump! Make inertia your friend and fly! But not actually, as you might go too far and fall!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u25a0Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">One day, Chester the frog was looking at the newspaper.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There was usually nothing interesting in the news.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But there was nothing interesting in Chester's wallet either...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Suddenly, Chester spotted an ad for a good-paying job!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Just test the [Rocket Boot Prototype] and strike it rich!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u25a0Game Overview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hold a button to charge up and release to jump!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Calculate your height and overcome all obstacles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use the momentum of the bowling ball to your advantage!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u25a0Gameplay Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>-A challenging platformer!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>-Charge the rocket boots to elevate your jumps!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>-Wrestle against the weight of the magnetic bowling ball!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>-Each Level gets more difficult the farther you go!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>-Learn you can become a patient person by finding the patience you didn't know you had!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>-Between 1 and \u221e hours of frustrating gameplay!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>-Collect Infrognito Outfits!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>-Collect Music CDs and Dr. Toad Tokens!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>-Bonus unlockables at the end!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2677000/extras/Frog_Mt_Mctoad_2.png?t=1743057643\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2677000?t=1743057643","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2677000?t=1743057643","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2677000/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743057643","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2677000/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743057643","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2677000/extras/Frog_Ready_to_jump.png?t=1743057643\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Charge... keep charging... and then jump! Make inertia your friend and fly! But not actually, as you might go too far and fall!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u25a0Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">One day, Chester the frog was looking at the newspaper.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There was usually nothing interesting in the news.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But there was nothing interesting in Chester's wallet either...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Suddenly, Chester spotted an ad for a good-paying job!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Just